el{35} & =0+35 \\\\ 5(7)^{x} & =35\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nDividing both sides by $5,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5(7)^{x} & =35 \\\\ {7}^{x} & =7.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, since both sides of the equation share the same base $(7)$, we equate the exponents. This gives\n\n$$\nx=1.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the root of $f(x)$ is $x=1.$" 13194139534408 true] [17592186286788 1000 #edb/ref 17592186286789 13194139534408 true] [17592186286788 1000 #edb/ref 17592186286790 13194139534408 true] [17592186286788 1000 #edb/ref 17592186286791 13194139534408 true] [17592186286788 1000 #edb/ref 17592186286792 13194139534408 true] [17592186286788 1000 #edb/ref 17592186286793 13194139534408 true] [17592186286788 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534408 true] [17592186286788 1041 "selection" 13194139534408 true] [17592186286788 1104 #edb/ref 17592186286790 13194139534408 true] [17592186286788 1110 #uuid "ca9238ac-e029-5c05-adf1-5c48df5218f1" 13194139534408 true] [17592186286789 1034 "7" 13194139534408 true] [17592186286789 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534408 true] [17592186286789 1111 #uuid "6cc4d310-60c9-5977-939f-8371e8c860b5" 13194139534408 true] [17592186286790 1034 "1" 13194139534408 true] [17592186286790 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534408 true] [17592186286790 1111 #uuid "5947e9d6-2edc-52a9-b6fc-c721fae742e3" 13194139534408 true] [17592186286791 1034 "\\frac{1}{5}" 13194139534408 true] [17592186286791 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534408 true] [17592186286791 1111 #uuid "4298dac3-f178-569d-b697-dc98b1b0c7c0" 13194139534408 true] [17592186286792 1034 "0" 13194139534408 true] [17592186286792 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534408 true] [17592186286792 1111 #uuid "30068cb8-2ff2-5e52-9cd8-ac4fb2fadc87" 13194139534408 true] [17592186286793 1034 "5" 13194139534408 true] [17592186286793 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534408 true] [17592186286793 1111 #uuid "8543886e-97e0-5c44-a085-74b60a7cb407" 13194139534408 true]] :edb/tempids {"q-102416" 1759218628